WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.898
So you want to learn something.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.950
YouTube has the answer. Somewhere. In one of four million videos.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:11.946
Good luck.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.191
Vortex takes the best teaching on YouTube and puts it in order.

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.064
Real courses, lesson by lesson, with every creator credited.

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.665
Stuck on something? Just ask, in plain English.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.419
Vortex finds the lesson, and the exact moment it's explained.

8
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.853
Life happens. Dinner's ready. The dog needs a walk.

9
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.333
Come back whenever. Your place is saved to the second.

10
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.078
When a video ends, a quick quiz checks what actually stuck.

11
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.228
Missed a few? Retake it until you've got it.

12
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.804
And for anything that isn't a course yet, describe your goal.

13
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.185
Sourdough, say. Vortex builds you a plan, one video at a time.

14
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.379
Vortex.

15
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.156
Learn anything, the way a course teaches it.
